---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="How The New Manager Hub uses affiliate links and earns revenue.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-6" style="font-family: var(--font-serif);">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>

    <div class="space-y-4 text-stone-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        <strong>The New Manager Hub</strong> is a participant in affiliate programs including the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program and other affiliate advertising programs designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-8 mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-serif);">What this means for you</h2>
      <p>
        Some links on this site are affiliate links. When you click on one and make a purchase, we may receive a small commission. <strong>This comes at no extra cost to you</strong> — the price you pay is the same whether you use our link or not.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-8 mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-serif);">Our commitment</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li>We only recommend products and services we genuinely believe are useful for new managers.</li>
        <li>Affiliate relationships never influence our ratings, rankings, or editorial opinions.</li>
        <li>If we think something isn't worth the money, we'll say so — even if it has a lucrative affiliate program.</li>
        <li>We clearly identify content that contains affiliate links.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-8 mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-serif);">Programs we participate in</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Amazon Associates</strong> — for book recommendations</li>
        <li><strong>Course platform affiliates</strong> — Udemy, Coursera, LinkedIn Learning</li>
        <li><strong>SaaS referral programs</strong> — for management tools we recommend</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-stone-500 italic">
        This disclosure is provided in accordance with the Federal Trade Commission's 16 CFR, Part 255: "Guides Concerning the Use of Endorsements and Testimonials in Advertising."
      </p>

      <p class="mt-4">
        Questions? Reach out at <strong>hello@newmanagershub.com</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
